Message. Say it with me. Message!

7
00:00:33.978 --> 00:00:37.712
Send. Say it with me. Send!

8
00:00:41.157 --> 00:00:44.849
Feeling. Say it with me. Feeling!

9
00:00:48.413 --> 00:00:51.947
Symbol. Say it with me. Symbol!

10
00:00:55.411 --> 00:00:59.137
Text. Say it with me. Text!

11
00:01:02.671 --> 00:01:06.989
