13
00:01:18.264 --> 00:01:27.545
An emoji is a small symbol that helps express a feeling in a message. I can send a text with an emoji to communicate how I feel.

14
00:01:27.595 --> 00:01:31.009
Now I understand. Thank you, Ms. Emily!

15
