Send!

17
00:01:39.503 --> 00:01:45.161
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:45.211 --> 00:01:46.409
Express!

19
00:01:47.706 --> 00:01:53.625
Did you know? The word 'emoji' comes from Japanese words meaning 'picture' and 'character'!

20
00:01:53.675 --> 00:01:55.848
